            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngasengibona isithunywa esilamandla simemeza ngelizwi elikhulu sisithi: Ngubani ofanele ukuvula lincwadi lokuqhaqha impawu zayo na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwakungekho lamunye ezulwini, lasemhlabeni, langaphansi komhlaba owayelamandla okuyivula incwadi, lokukhangela phakathi kwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhala kakhulu ngoba kungafunyanwanga loyedwa ofanele ukuyivula incwadi, lokukhangela phakathi kwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omunye wabadala wasesithi kimi: Ungakhali; ngoba sinqobile iSilwane sesizwe sakoJuda, iMpande kaDavida, ukuze siyivule lincwadi, siqhaqhe lezimpawu zayo eziyisikhombisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
